. *============================================================================
> ==
. * gaci_tables_export.do  --  emit machine-readable result lines for the Word 
> tables
. *   TAB1 = main OLS vs IV (robust + clustered SE), 3 outcomes x 2 treatments
. *   TAB2 = heterogeneity (split-sample, robust SE), 3 outcomes x subgroups
. *   spec: country+year FE, IV = feyrer_int, control ln_sea_ma (+lngdp for vol
> ume)
. *============================================================================
> ==
